Package: metacor
Type: Package
Title: Meta-Analytic Effect Size Calculation for Pre-Post Designs with Correlation Imputation
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = c("Iker", "J."), family = "Bautista", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ikerugr@gmail.com"), person(given = c("Saul", "M."), family = "Rodriguez", role = "ctb", email = "saulmrguez@gmail.com"))
Maintainer: Iker J. Bautista <ikerugr@gmail.com>
Description: Tools for the calculation of effect sizes (i.e., standardized mean differences [SMDs], mean difference) in pre-post controlled studies with or without control group, including robust imputation of missing variances and correlations. The main function metacor_dual implements several methods for imputing missing standard deviation of differences scorec (SDdiff) or correlation coefficients, and generates transparent imputation reports. Designed for meta-analyses with incomplete summary statistics.
